<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:12.100" end="00:00:17.000" style="s2">Ladies and gentlemen, the president of</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.200" end="00:00:20.000" style="s2">the United States, Donald J. Trump,</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.000" end="00:00:23.700" style="s2">accompanied by the president and CEO of</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.000" end="00:00:23.700" style="s2">UFC, Dana White.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.600" end="00:01:09.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, thank you very much and</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.500" end="00:01:11.800" style="s2">please be seated and enjoy yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.600" end="00:01:14.300" style="s2">This is to me great enjoyment because</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.800" end="00:01:15.700" style="s2">we&#39;re celebrating greatness</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.300" end="00:01:17.900" style="s2">and these people and the people that</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.700" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">work with them.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.900" end="00:01:22.500" style="s2">Today is my</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:25.400" style="s2">honor to welcome you all to our first</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.500" end="00:01:28.700" style="s2">official event on the new</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.400" end="00:01:30.200" style="s2">White House helipad. This is a big one.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.700" end="00:01:31.600" style="s2">I said, give me a helipad. I didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.200" end="00:01:33.100" style="s2">it was going to be this big, but people</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.600" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">love it. In fact, it&#39;s so good I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.100" end="00:01:37.600" style="s2">even get sued when I built it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.100" end="00:01:39.100" style="s2">That&#39;s they wanted to sue. They had it</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.600" end="00:01:41.400" style="s2">already. Then they saw it and they said,</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.100" end="00:01:42.800" style="s2">bad, this thing is amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.400" end="00:01:44.300" style="s2">And it&#39;s all going to be amazing and</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.800" end="00:01:46.000" style="s2">that&#39;s going to be the most amazing of</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.300" end="00:01:48.000" style="s2">all what we&#39;re building for the White</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.000" end="00:01:50.700" style="s2">House. They&#39;ve been looking for that for</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.000" end="00:01:53.900" style="s2">150 years, the ballroom</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:55.200" style="s2">and the great military complex inside.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.900" end="00:01:57.100" style="s2">But this afternoon, I&#39;m pleased to</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.200" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">announce that my good friend Dana White,</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.100" end="00:02:02.392" style="s2">a legend, true a legend, what a man he</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.492" end="00:02:04.792" style="s2">And I am personally presenting the</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.392" end="00:02:05.992" style="s2">president&#39;s own United States Marine</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.792" end="00:02:08.592" style="s2">band</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.992" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">with a donation. Now it started off at</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.592" end="00:02:11.992" style="s2">200,000</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.492" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">and I said how many people are there? I</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.992" end="00:02:15.892" style="s2">thought there were 70</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.892" end="00:02:17.692" style="s2">but it&#39;s about 170. I don&#39;t know a lot</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.892" end="00:02:19.792" style="s2">of people joined.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.692" end="00:02:20.992" style="s2">So we decided to increase it, right</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.792" end="00:02:22.892" style="s2">Dana?</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.992" end="00:02:25.392" style="s2">So we were going to give 200,000 we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.892" end="00:02:27.392" style="s2">now making it 500,000. Now everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.392" end="00:02:29.192" style="s2">going to get a lot of money.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.392" end="00:02:31.092" style="s2">All right? That would</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.192" end="00:02:32.492" style="s2">It took me about 1 second to get that</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.092" end="00:02:33.992" style="s2">from Dana. I said do you want to go and</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.492" end="00:02:36.992" style="s2">double up?</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.992" end="00:02:39.692" style="s2">And it&#39;s our honor because it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.992" end="00:02:42.292" style="s2">that&#39;s a good little amount of money and</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.692" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">it&#39;s on really fantastic. And this</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.292" end="00:02:46.492" style="s2">really began because</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:49.692" style="s2">Dana and I at the fight it&#39;s the highest</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.492" end="00:02:51.092" style="s2">rated fight in the history of this whole</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.692" end="00:02:52.192" style="s2">world</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.092" end="00:02:54.192" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.192" end="00:02:55.592" style="s2">the music was so good.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.192" end="00:02:57.192" style="s2">Now the fights were great and they were</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.592" end="00:02:58.892" style="s2">among the best fights anyone&#39;s ever</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.192" end="00:03:00.992" style="s2">seen. That last fight</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.892" end="00:03:04.292" style="s2">was the last two fights but you could</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.992" end="00:03:06.192" style="s2">really see every single fight was ended</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.292" end="00:03:07.892" style="s2">in knockouts all</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.192" end="00:03:09.092" style="s2">and great champions. Everyone was a</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.892" end="00:03:10.592" style="s2">champion</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.092" end="00:03:12.692" style="s2">and it was the best night and it was</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.592" end="00:03:14.092" style="s2">supposed to be a horrible horrible</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.692" end="00:03:15.092" style="s2">weather. We didn&#39;t know what was going</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.092" end="00:03:16.992" style="s2">to happen.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.092" end="00:03:18.992" style="s2">In fact we delayed it because we thought</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.992" end="00:03:20.692" style="s2">and if you lived a mile that way or a</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.992" end="00:03:22.192" style="s2">mile that way</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.692" end="00:03:24.092" style="s2">friends called me up they said how can</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.192" end="00:03:26.492" style="s2">you be having a fight?</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.092" end="00:03:28.792" style="s2">The clouds came and as soon as it got to</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.492" end="00:03:30.192" style="s2">the White House right over there</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.792" end="00:03:31.692" style="s2">they opened up</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.192" end="00:03:33.392" style="s2">and everything was drenched. We didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.692" end="00:03:35.192" style="s2">have one drop.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.392" end="00:03:36.992" style="s2">We were waiting. This was not good. We</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.192" end="00:03:39.892" style="s2">said we&#39;re in big trouble</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.992" end="00:03:41.492" style="s2">but it was sort of a miracle evening and</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.892" end="00:03:43.792" style="s2">with the White House in the background</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.492" end="00:03:44.892" style="s2">and the ring was exactly here where this</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.792" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">was and</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.892" end="00:03:48.192" style="s2">I started construction of this the</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.492" end="00:03:51.217" style="s2">following day</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.192" end="00:03:52.692" style="s2">and it&#39;s exactly the size of the entire</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.217" end="00:03:55.392" style="s2">[snorts] the entire ring and that was</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.692" end="00:03:56.892" style="s2">some some fight. We had 100,000 people</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.392" end="00:03:59.792" style="s2">in the park</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.892" end="00:04:01.392" style="s2">and we had probably 6,000 7,000 people</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.792" end="00:04:02.392" style="s2">here in front in the backdrop of the</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.392" end="00:04:03.794" style="s2">White House.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.392" end="00:04:05.594" style="s2">I don&#39;t think it&#39;ll ever happen again,</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.794" end="00:04:07.894" style="s2">Dana. I don&#39;t think. And on top of it,</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.594" end="00:04:09.494" style="s2">they were the best fights. Justin</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.894" end="00:04:12.194" style="s2">Gaethje won.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.494" end="00:04:13.794" style="s2">And he was not favored.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.194" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">And he fought the fight of his life and</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.794" end="00:04:17.794" style="s2">he won.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.494" end="00:04:19.094" style="s2">Did a lot of damage. He won give a lot</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.794" end="00:04:20.394" style="s2">of damage.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.094" end="00:04:22.094" style="s2">But people said it was among the</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.394" end="00:04:23.994" style="s2">greatest events they&#39;ve ever seen and it</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.094" end="00:04:26.294" style="s2">was an honor to be there.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.994" end="00:04:28.294" style="s2">But the thing that was</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.294" end="00:04:30.494" style="s2">equal to was the music, the quality of</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.294" end="00:04:31.594" style="s2">the music. And Dana and I were walking</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.494" end="00:04:33.294" style="s2">out</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.594" end="00:04:34.494" style="s2">and</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.294" end="00:04:37.094" style="s2">we heard</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.494" end="00:04:39.994" style="s2">the cucaracha and we heard that was for</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.094" end="00:04:41.994" style="s2">the Mexican champion who also won.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.994" end="00:04:43.794" style="s2">And we heard all these different songs,</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.994" end="00:04:45.794" style="s2">most of which we knew, but it was better</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.794" end="00:04:47.494" style="s2">than the original.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.794" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">We thought it was a</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.494" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">recording. We said nobody could play</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:53.894" style="s2">that well. And it turned out it was</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.094" end="00:04:55.294" style="s2">these incredibly talented people that</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.894" end="00:04:56.794" style="s2">are with us.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.294" end="00:04:59.494" style="s2">And I said, Dana, we got to give them a</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.794" end="00:05:01.694" style="s2">big bonus here for the job they did.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.494" end="00:05:03.894" style="s2">And I mean, I will tell you, this wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.694" end="00:05:06.194" style="s2">doesn&#39;t involve Dana as much, but they</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.894" end="00:05:08.094" style="s2">also played for the</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.194" end="00:05:11.394" style="s2">President of China who came here a few</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.094" end="00:05:12.894" style="s2">weeks ago and for King Charles.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.394" end="00:05:14.794" style="s2">And they were unbelievable. They&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.894" end="00:05:15.794" style="s2">amazingly talented. Many of them could</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.794" end="00:05:17.694" style="s2">be in</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.794" end="00:05:19.394" style="s2">any of the greatest orchestras in the</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.694" end="00:05:20.594" style="s2">world, Carnegie Hall. They could be</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.394" end="00:05:21.794" style="s2">anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.594" end="00:05:23.194" style="s2">Many of them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.794" end="00:05:24.594" style="s2">But they love the military. They love</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.194" end="00:05:27.494" style="s2">our country.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.594" end="00:05:30.094" style="s2">So Dana and I are contributing</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.494" end="00:05:32.394" style="s2">the $500,000</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.094" end="00:05:35.594" style="s2">to express our immense appreciation for</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.394" end="00:05:37.694" style="s2">your spectacular talent, unwavering</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.594" end="00:05:39.794" style="s2">professionalism which it is, and total</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.694" end="00:05:41.894" style="s2">commitment to excellence</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.794" end="00:05:43.494" style="s2">in everything that you&#39;ve done. And that</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.894" end="00:05:46.394" style="s2">includes those people that make it</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.494" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">possible for you to play so well.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.394" end="00:05:50.594" style="s2">So as president,</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.994" end="00:05:52.494" style="s2">I&#39;ve admired you from the very first day</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.594" end="00:05:54.094" style="s2">of my first term.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.494" end="00:05:55.794" style="s2">We&#39;d have little events and you&#39;d play</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.094" end="00:05:57.594" style="s2">and I say, wow, they&#39;re great. You I</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.794" end="00:05:59.094" style="s2">mean, the bad part is you usually blew</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.594" end="00:06:01.594" style="s2">away the artist. You know, we bring in</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.094" end="00:06:03.294" style="s2">these big artists, Dana. Big names, but</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.594" end="00:06:04.594" style="s2">they blow them away.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.294" end="00:06:06.494" style="s2">They they don&#39;t even like going out</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.594" end="00:06:08.769" style="s2">after watching you. You have more talent</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.494" end="00:06:10.789" style="s2">than they do. I hate to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.769" end="00:06:10.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.069" end="00:06:50.089" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.895" end="00:07:29.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really great job.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.295" end="00:07:29.195" style="s2">I&#39;m so proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.495" end="00:07:35.395" style="s2">And we&#39;re also pleased to be joined by</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.595" end="00:07:37.495" style="s2">three people who I know you are very</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:39.095" style="s2">familiar with and share my great</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.495" end="00:07:40.995" style="s2">appreciation for this group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.095" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">outstanding skill.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.995" end="00:07:44.995" style="s2">A man who is absolutely admired by most,</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.895" end="00:07:47.395" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.995" end="00:07:49.395" style="s2">he does so well that they&#39;re jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.395" end="00:07:51.195" style="s2">And they want to get him, but they don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.395" end="00:07:53.595" style="s2">take him. They like you. They don&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.195" end="00:07:55.595" style="s2">him down very easily. He&#39;s been actually</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.595" end="00:07:57.295" style="s2">outstanding. So we won in Venezuela in</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.595" end="00:07:59.395" style="s2">48 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.295" end="00:08:01.395" style="s2">And we&#39;re knocking the hell out of him</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.395" end="00:08:03.295" style="s2">in a And we&#39;re being nice. We&#39;re being</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.395" end="00:08:06.795" style="s2">very nice, but they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.295" end="00:08:09.097" style="s2">Navy&#39;s gone. Their Air Force is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.795" end="00:08:10.597" style="s2">Frankly, their leaders are gone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.097" end="00:08:12.997" style="s2">Everything&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.597" end="00:08:14.497" style="s2">And we&#39;ll see how that</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.997" end="00:08:17.097" style="s2">We&#39;re being very nice. We&#39;re being</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.497" end="00:08:18.597" style="s2">patient. We&#39;re being very patient.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.097" end="00:08:20.997" style="s2">But it&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.597" end="00:08:22.997" style="s2">amazing to watch him and</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.997" end="00:08:24.697" style="s2">General Kane and all of the others. But</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.997" end="00:08:25.697" style="s2">I want to just introduce Secretary of</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.697" end="00:08:28.097" style="s2">War</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.697" end="00:08:31.897" style="s2">Pete Hegseth, who has been a star. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.097" end="00:08:31.897" style="s2">you, Pete. Thank you very much.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.997" end="00:08:35.797" style="s2">And he goes and he works out with the</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.297" end="00:08:37.097" style="s2">guys, but I don&#39;t know. He&#39;s really in</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.797" end="00:08:39.097" style="s2">good shape, but some of those guys are</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.097" end="00:08:40.075" style="s2">tough, right? They&#39;re tough to work out</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.097" end="00:08:43.397" style="s2">with.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.075" end="00:08:47.897" style="s2">[snorts] Acting Secretary of the Navy</p>
