<p begin="00:16:26.602" end="00:16:31.302" style="s2">32 different artists, many with custom</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.602" end="00:16:33.902" style="s2">arrangements, and</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.302" end="00:16:36.102" style="s2">in the days before the event, they spent</p>
