<p begin="00:19:09.003" end="00:19:13.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, ladies and gentlemen.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.403" end="00:19:15.203" style="s2">Mr. President, Mr. White, thank you very</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.003" end="00:19:17.703" style="s2">much for your generosity and for your</p>
