<p begin="00:19:20.003" end="00:19:23.003" style="s2">your support and being here. Speaker</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.403" end="00:19:24.303" style="s2">Johnson, you honor us with your</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.003" end="00:19:26.703" style="s2">presence.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.303" end="00:19:29.803" style="s2">Mr. Secretary, appreciate your support</p>
