<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:37.903" style="s2">Band, this party is for you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.103" end="00:19:40.303" style="s2">We are so grateful for the opportunity</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.903" end="00:19:42.503" style="s2">to perform for you today, Mr. President.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.303" end="00:19:45.603" style="s2">We&#39;re so grateful for your continued</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.503" end="00:19:47.303" style="s2">support of music, the arts, and the</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.603" end="00:19:49.503" style="s2">United States Marine Band. We have a</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.303" end="00:19:50.903" style="s2">special program that we&#39;ve put together</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.503" end="00:19:54.103" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.903" end="00:19:55.803" style="s2">This organization dates back to 1798,</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.103" end="00:19:57.803" style="s2">the beginnings of our country, as the</p>
