<p begin="00:20:10.303" end="00:20:14.303" style="s2">have played for John Philip Sousa, who</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.503" end="00:20:15.603" style="s2">played to the founding of our country.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.303" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">And if you think about how you learn</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.603" end="00:20:20.103" style="s2">music</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:22.303" style="s2">and play in an ensemble, you sit and you</p>
