<p begin="00:20:25.005" end="00:20:30.205" style="s2">feed the musicians, and it&#39;s passed down</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.305" end="00:20:33.005" style="s2">generation to generation, hand to hand,</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.205" end="00:20:35.505" style="s2">heart to heart, and it is the living</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.005" end="00:20:37.905" style="s2">embodiment of American history and</p>
