<p begin="00:20:42.205" end="00:20:46.505" style="s2">you recognized that today. Mr. White,</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.505" end="00:20:48.305" style="s2">you heard that at the UFC fight and all</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.505" end="00:20:50.505" style="s2">of these other events, and it is our</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.305" end="00:20:52.105" style="s2">honor to serve in this incredibly</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:54.205" style="s2">special way.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.105" end="00:20:55.705" style="s2">This is America&#39;s band.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.205" end="00:20:57.205" style="s2">We want to bring it to every home, to</p>
