<p begin="00:29:31.140" end="00:29:33.160" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.585" end="00:29:45.605" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.135" end="00:29:52.155" style="s2">[music]</p>
