<p begin="00:30:48.112" end="00:30:50.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.946" end="00:30:58.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.426" end="00:31:09.446" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.976" end="00:31:15.996" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.421" end="00:31:28.441" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.316" end="00:31:34.336" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.831" end="00:31:42.851" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.036" end="00:31:50.056" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.197" end="00:32:37.217" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.782" end="00:32:41.802" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.297" end="00:32:50.317" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.502" end="00:32:57.522" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.532" end="00:33:14.552" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.513" end="00:33:22.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re so proud to</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.013" end="00:33:25.713" style="s2">serve in our country in this way through</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.313" end="00:33:28.313" style="s2">our music as are so many so many around</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.713" end="00:33:30.613" style="s2">the world. Our next piece honors</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.313" end="00:33:32.613" style="s2">all service members, anyone who has</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.613" end="00:33:36.313" style="s2">served, all of those who have been</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.613" end="00:33:38.413" style="s2">impacted by service now or back in their</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.313" end="00:33:40.913" style="s2">families generations. This piece is</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.413" end="00:33:43.313" style="s2">called Let Freedom Ring and is a piece I</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.913" end="00:33:45.013" style="s2">composed based on the famous melody My</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:46.713" style="s2">Country, &#39;Tis of Thee.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.013" end="00:33:49.113" style="s2">I focused on the lyric Land Where My</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.713" end="00:33:50.613" style="s2">Fathers Died because not a day goes by</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.113" end="00:33:53.513" style="s2">that we don&#39;t think of those who have</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.613" end="00:33:55.413" style="s2">sacrificed for us to be able to have the</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.513" end="00:33:58.913" style="s2">freedoms that we have today.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.413" end="00:33:58.913" style="s2">This is Let Freedom Ring.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.448" end="00:34:15.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
