<p begin="00:37:58.116" end="00:38:00.136" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.416" end="00:38:12.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you ladies and gentlemen. Going to</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.216" end="00:38:15.116" style="s2">move to something a little different</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.616" end="00:38:17.816" style="s2">now. I&#39;d like to welcome up one of our</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.116" end="00:38:20.016" style="s2">vocalists to the stage.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.816" end="00:38:23.616" style="s2">This next piece is a setting of Amazing</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.016" end="00:38:25.516" style="s2">Grace. This Amazing Grace is for our</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.616" end="00:38:26.916" style="s2">everyone, but it is also in honor of our</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.516" end="00:38:29.116" style="s2">beloved Marine Corps. And if you listen</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.916" end="00:38:31.616" style="s2">closely, you&#39;ll hear us slowly</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.116" end="00:38:33.116" style="s2">insert elements of the Marines hymn</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.616" end="00:38:34.116" style="s2">throughout the course of this Amazing</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.116" end="00:38:36.516" style="s2">Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.116" end="00:38:38.816" style="s2">And it&#39;s my pleasure to welcome to sing</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.516" end="00:38:41.316" style="s2">this rendition arranged of Amazing</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.816" end="00:38:43.516" style="s2">Grace, our very own Mr. White, you know</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.316" end="00:38:46.116" style="s2">her very well, Staff Sergeant Hannah</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.516" end="00:38:46.116" style="s2">Davis.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.241" end="00:38:49.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.787" end="00:39:14.807" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.682" end="00:39:20.702" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.232" end="00:39:29.217" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.517" end="00:39:29.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amazing [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.317" end="00:39:33.747" style="s2">grace,</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.127" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">[music] how sweet</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.747" end="00:39:39.217" style="s2">[singing] the sound</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.617" end="00:39:41.617" style="s2">that saved</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.217" end="00:39:45.417" style="s2">a wretch</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.617" end="00:39:45.417" style="s2">like me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.117" end="00:39:52.017" style="s2">I once</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.417" end="00:39:54.707" style="s2">was lost,</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.017" end="00:39:57.117" style="s2">but now</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.707" end="00:39:59.817" style="s2">[singing] I&#39;m found.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.117" end="00:40:02.517" style="s2">Was blind,</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.817" end="00:40:06.317" style="s2">but [singing] now</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.517" end="00:40:06.317" style="s2">I see.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.152" end="00:40:10.482" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.462" end="00:40:10.482" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.872" end="00:40:24.892" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.417" end="00:40:33.517" style="s2">&#39;Twas grace [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.217" end="00:40:35.817" style="s2">that taught</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.517" end="00:40:38.217" style="s2">my heart</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.817" end="00:40:40.617" style="s2">to fear, [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.217" end="00:40:45.798" style="s2">and grace</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.617" end="00:40:47.818" style="s2">my fears relieved.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.798" end="00:40:47.818" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.917" end="00:40:53.018" style="s2">How precious [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.038" end="00:40:55.623" style="s2">[singing] did</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.018" end="00:40:57.918" style="s2">that grace</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.623" end="00:41:02.918" style="s2">[singing] appear [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.918" end="00:41:05.503" style="s2">the hour I first</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.918" end="00:41:05.503" style="s2">believed. [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.273" end="00:41:17.293" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.443" end="00:41:26.463" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.518" end="00:41:32.918" style="s2">Through many [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.993" end="00:41:36.818" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.918" end="00:41:39.718" style="s2">dangers, toils and [singing] snares,</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.818" end="00:41:39.718" style="s2">I have</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.818" end="00:41:44.418" style="s2">already</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.318" end="00:41:44.418" style="s2">come.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.118" end="00:41:51.918" style="s2">&#39;Twas</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.988" end="00:41:53.718" style="s2">[screaming] grace</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.918" end="00:41:57.918" style="s2">that brought</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.718" end="00:42:00.218" style="s2">me [singing] safe thus far,</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.918" end="00:42:03.118" style="s2">and grace</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.218" end="00:42:05.218" style="s2">will lead me</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.118" end="00:42:05.218" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.318" end="00:42:18.118" style="s2">And grace</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.018" end="00:42:21.118" style="s2">will [singing] lead</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.118" end="00:42:21.118" style="s2">me</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.518" end="00:42:24.104" style="s2">home. [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.014" end="00:42:28.034" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.599" end="00:42:32.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.974" end="00:42:48.994" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.820" end="00:43:01.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Thank you all very much.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.220" end="00:43:03.520" style="s2">Staff Sergeant Hannah Davis, ladies and</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.020" end="00:43:03.520" style="s2">gentlemen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.720" end="00:43:12.920" style="s2">We&#39;re going to keep Hannah here singing</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.220" end="00:43:14.720" style="s2">for you just for two our final two</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.920" end="00:43:17.120" style="s2">selections. First, Mr. President, your</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.720" end="00:43:19.520" style="s2">request for Miss Davis and for you, this</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.120" end="00:43:23.220" style="s2">is America the Beautiful. And we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.520" end="00:43:25.420" style="s2">follow that with uh God Bless America,</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.220" end="00:43:28.020" style="s2">which will invite you all to join us in</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.420" end="00:43:29.920" style="s2">singing along. Mr. President, Mr. White,</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.020" end="00:43:32.220" style="s2">everybody, thank you very much for this</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.920" end="00:43:34.620" style="s2">opportunity to be here today for</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.220" end="00:43:37.920" style="s2">receiving us so kindly and acknowledging</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.620" end="00:43:40.220" style="s2">these incredible musicians that I have</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.920" end="00:43:41.920" style="s2">just the blessed opportunity to lead.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.220" end="00:43:43.420" style="s2">It&#39;s a stewardship. Take care of the</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.920" end="00:43:45.020" style="s2">organization as long as it&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.420" end="00:43:47.320" style="s2">entrusted to me and I&#39;m very grateful</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.020" end="00:43:49.320" style="s2">for that opportunity. So thank you very</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.320" end="00:43:51.920" style="s2">very much. This is America the</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.320" end="00:43:51.920" style="s2">Beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.055" end="00:44:18.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
