<p begin="00:44:26.620" end="00:44:32.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh beautiful [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.220" end="00:44:33.920" style="s2">for spacious</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.820" end="00:44:41.120" style="s2">skies, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.920" end="00:44:43.565" style="s2">for amber waves [singing] of grain,</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.120" end="00:44:45.520" style="s2">for purple</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.565" end="00:44:47.495" style="s2">[singing] mountain</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.520" end="00:44:48.320" style="s2">majesties</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.495" end="00:44:50.420" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.320" end="00:44:50.420" style="s2">above</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.820" end="00:44:54.761" style="s2">the fruit</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.620" end="00:44:54.761" style="s2">and plain. [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.721" end="00:44:58.221" style="s2">America,</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.941" end="00:45:09.421" style="s2">[singing] America,</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.921" end="00:45:09.421" style="s2">God shed his grace on [singing] thee,</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.321" end="00:45:17.921" style="s2">and crown</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.821" end="00:45:17.921" style="s2">thy [singing] good with brotherhood</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.321" end="00:45:24.176" style="s2">from sea to</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.921" end="00:45:26.196" style="s2">sea.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.176" end="00:45:26.196" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.381" end="00:45:33.401" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.586" end="00:45:40.606" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.421" end="00:45:51.521" style="s2">Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.921" end="00:45:52.621" style="s2">beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.521" end="00:45:56.821" style="s2">for</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.621" end="00:45:59.321" style="s2">heroes proved in</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.821" end="00:45:59.321" style="s2">liberating</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.521" end="00:46:01.721" style="s2">strife,</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.321" end="00:46:04.421" style="s2">who</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.521" end="00:46:11.821" style="s2">more than self their country loved,</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.521" end="00:46:11.821" style="s2">and mercy</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.221" end="00:46:16.221" style="s2">more than</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.121" end="00:46:16.221" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.721" end="00:46:18.921" style="s2">America,</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.921" end="00:46:23.221" style="s2">America,</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.821" end="00:46:28.121" style="s2">God shed</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.921" end="00:46:30.387" style="s2">his grace</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.121" end="00:46:30.387" style="s2">on thee, [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.421" end="00:46:33.607" style="s2">and</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.321" end="00:46:34.321" style="s2">crown</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.607" end="00:46:35.921" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.321" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">thy good</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.921" end="00:46:39.121" style="s2">with</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.921" end="00:46:39.121" style="s2">brotherhood</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.121" end="00:46:46.721" style="s2">from sea to</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.821" end="00:46:48.821" style="s2">shining</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.721" end="00:46:48.821" style="s2">sea.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.321" end="00:46:51.521" style="s2">America,</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.121" end="00:46:54.622" style="s2">America.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.602" end="00:46:54.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.007" end="00:47:28.027" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.922" end="00:47:32.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God bless America, [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.723" end="00:47:41.523" style="s2">land that I love. Stand beside her and</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.223" end="00:47:45.622" style="s2">guide her through the night with a light</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.523" end="00:47:49.323" style="s2">from above. From the mountains to the</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.622" end="00:47:51.422" style="s2">prairies, [singing] to the oceans white</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.323" end="00:47:54.622" style="s2">with foam,</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.422" end="00:47:58.922" style="s2">God bless America,</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.622" end="00:48:02.223" style="s2">my home sweet home.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.922" end="00:48:07.273" style="s2">God bless America,</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.223" end="00:48:07.928" style="s2">my home sweet home.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.273" end="00:48:09.948" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.928" end="00:48:09.948" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.023" end="00:48:36.523" style="s2">God bless America,</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.223" end="00:48:40.422" style="s2">my home sweet home.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.523" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">God bless America,</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.422" end="00:48:47.223" style="s2">my home sweet</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.122" end="00:48:47.223" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.224" end="00:49:33.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your time.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
